@title Duct runs: pick a duct in 3D, read the runs in it (1920x1080)
@area 3D
@sizes 1920x1080
# Open the Wire runs panel (Ctrl+K), click a duct in the 3D view: the panel shows its fill and every run in it, and lights them.
open_starter_example
wait 20
resize 1920 1080
wait 10
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text wire runs
wait 4
key Enter
wait 40
shot before
click 1100 420
wait 60
shot duct-picked
expect "Duct at"
expect "runs,"
expect "Select its"
